6edb" :question/id #uuid "d9db989a-3f87-5629-a87a-c9abbaf56edb"] [:db/add "d9db989a-3f87-5629-a87a-c9abbaf56edb" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=-7xy$ and its slope field. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply."] [:db/add "d9db989a-3f87-5629-a87a-c9abbaf56edb" :question/worked-solution "First, we define $f(x,y)=-7xy.$ Then, our differential equation is $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=f(x,y).$ \n\nNotice that $f(x,y)=0$ when $x=0$ or $y=0.$ The lines $x=0$ and $y=0$ divide the plane into the usual four quadrants.\n\nIf we compute the sign of $f(x,y)$ in each quadrant (by considering some test points, for example), we get the following:\n\n![](images/2c/2c218c7df2bf4e159b4bffaccb4296beab8e3f44ab82d56b3589050af92ccf8e.png)\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement:\n\n- Statement “At every point in the second quadrant, the slope of the slope field is positive” is true. If $(x,y)$ is in the second quadrant, then according to our diagram, we have\n\n$$\n{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(x,y)}=f(x,y)>0.\n$$\n\nThis implies that the slope of the slope field is positive for any point $(x,y)$ in the second quadrant.\n\n- Statement “At every point in the third quadrant, the slope of the slope field is positive” is false. If $(x,y)$ is in the third quadrant, then according to our diagram, we have\n\n$$\n{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(x,y)}=f(x,y)<0.\n$$\n\nThis implies that the slope of the slope field is negative for any point $(x,y)$ in the third quadrant.\n\n- Statement “At every point in the fourth quadrant, the slope of the slope field is negative” is false. If $(x,y)$ is in the fourth quadrant, then according to our diagram, we have\n\n$$\n{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{(x,y)}=f(x,y)>0.\n$$\n\nThis implies that the slope of the slope field is positive for any point $(x,y)$ in the fourth quadrant.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “At every point in the second quadrant, the slope of the slope field is positive” only."] [:db/add "d9db989a-3f87-5629-a87a-c9abbaf56edb" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "d9db989a-3f87-5629-a87a-c9abbaf56edb" :question/answer-fields "266dc37a-fa0b-50a4-bb31-698554827674"] [:db/add "d9db989a-3f87-5629-a87a-c9abbaf56edb" :question/answer-fields "f83d6fba-5852-58c9-b9bb-f61acd74da44"] [:db/add "d9db989a-3f87-5629-a87a-c9abbaf56edb" :question/answer-fields "2e6071a0-256f-5964-960c-364249476b25"] [:db/add "d9db989a-3f87-5629-a87a-c9abbaf56edb" :question/answer-fields "3abdb873-60fc-55d5-98e2-1e44acf59d98"] [:db/ensure "d9db989a-3f87-5629-a87a-c9abbaf56edb" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186172039 :knowledge-point/questions "d9db989a-3f87-5629-a87a-c9abbaf56edb"] [:db/add "1862e18d-986b-5d28-b0d2-296a0d3c1090" :answer/id #uuid "1862e18d-986b-5d28-b0d2-296a0d3c1090"] [:db/add "1862e18d-986b-5d28-b0d2-296a0d3c1090" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "1862e18d-986b-5d28-b0d2-296a0d3c1090" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "1862e18d-986b-5d28-b0d2-296a0d3c1090" :answer/validate] [:db/add "666ceb38-febd-5cbb-a891-050c0272630e" :answer/id #uuid "666ceb38-febd-5cbb-a891-050c0272630e"] [:db/add "666ceb38-febd-5cbb-a891-050c0272630e" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "666ceb38-febd-5cbb-a891-050c0272630e" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "666ceb38-febd-5cbb-a891-050c0272630e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e4b661b9-6e36-5c48-b27d-843339c86705" :answer-field/id #uuid "e4b661b9-6e36-5c48-b27d-843339c86705"] [:db/add "e4b661b9-6e36-5c48-b27d-843339c86705" :answer-field/key "At every point in the second quadrant, the slope of the slope field is positive"] [:db/add "e4b661b9-6e36-5c48-b27d-843339c86705" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "e4b661b9-6e36-5c48-b27d-843339c86705" :answer-field/choices "1862e18d-986b-5d28-b0d2-296a0d3c1090"] [:db/add "e4b661b9-6e36-5c48-b27d-843339c86705" :answer-field/choices "666ceb38-febd-5cbb-a891-050c0272630e"] [:db/add "e4b